                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zUuUl",
                      "name": "npx shadcn init is not supported. Its pr",
                      "context": "MDXContent - p",
                      "fill": "#F0F0EE",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "npx shadcn init is not supported. Its preflight requires Tailwind on disk, and Ultima does not use Tailwind. The entry is a per-target setup item, which is a universal registry:item and installs into a project that has no components.json yet.",
