                      "name": "Point an agent at /llms.txt: the princip",
                      "context": "MDXContent - p",
                      "fill": "#F0F0EE",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Point an agent at /llms.txt: the principles, the conventions, every component's import and props, and the token names, as plain Markdown at one URL. It is generated on every build, and it is the only guidance Ultima publishes for a consumer's repository — nothing documentary is installed into yours.",
