                      "fill": "#F0F0EE",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "There is no IconButton and no iconOnly prop. An icon-only button is a recipe: aria-label for the name, the glyph as the only child, and a style override setting paddingInline to the size's block padding, so the glyph sits in even padding instead of the wider padding a label needs.",
